2. This Order applies to a licensee holding any of the following classes of liquor licences:
(a)a Class 3A liquor licence granted under regulation 4(1)(e) of the Liquor Control (Supply and Consumption) (Liquor Licensing) Regulations 2015 (G.N. No. S 181/2015);
(b)a Class 3B liquor licence granted under regulation 4(1)(f) of those Regulations;
(c)a Class 4 liquor licence granted under regulation 4(1)(g) of those Regulations.
